           Example::
       
               >>> # xdoctest: +IGNORE_WANT("non-deterministic")
               >>> m = Normal(torch.tensor([0.0]), torch.tensor([1.0]))
               >>> m.sample()  # normally distributed with loc=0 and scale=1
               tensor([ 0.1046])
       
           Args:
